BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Trajectory prediction: Earth-Moon transfer</h1>
A delta-glider in a 200 km Earth orbit in the ecliptic. The script
searches the time of a 3.13 km/s prograde node that brings it closest
to the Moon, and checks that the predicted trajectory enters the Moon's
sphere of influence and passes a periapsis there.
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 51982.6685767396
  Script Tests/TransferTest
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship GL-T
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET GL-T
  MODE Extern
  POS 4 0 -20
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 50.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_SHIPS
GL-T:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Orbiting Earth
  ELEMENTS 6571000.0 0.00000 0.0 0.0 0.0 0.0 51982.6685767396
  AROT 0 0 0
  PRPLEVEL 0:1.000 1:1.000
END
END_SHIPS
